+# Patches for CNC-PRO – Phases
+
+These patches are generated from branch `arena/01a083d7-cnc-pro` based on main at 3f2ae61.
+
+## Contents
+
+- `phase-fullDoors-slot-hinge.patch` – commit fa0e1c7:
+  - Full-cabinet doors L/R/Double variants (9 variants: off/mdf/glass/mdf-left/mdf-right/mdf-double/glass-left/glass-right/glass-double)
+  - slotFromFront editable per-cabinet & global (slotWidth 18mm)
+  - hinge bands auto <900→2 900-1799→3 1800-2399→4 2400-2999→5 ≥3000→6 with cups 140mm from ends
+  - 3D/2D full doors spanning stacked boxes
+  - door W/H overrides (wOverride/hOverride)
+  - See PREVIOUS_CHANGES_AFTER_MERGE.md for full reconstruction guide
+
+- `phase-3-5-exploded.patch` – commit 7d34fd8 (this session):
+  - **Phase #3 Back follows material**: Back panels now include `matId: cabinetPly.id` so 3D color follows plywood material and nesting groups `back@matId` per plywood. Both `buildBody` and `buildStackedBody` patched.
+  - **Phase #5 Panel drag in 2D**: View2DTab and PlanTab now support dragging raw panels (PanelItem) with snap 5mm, same as cabinets. App.tsx passes setPanels.
+  - **New O Exploded per-cabinet report**: New file `src/lib/explodedReport.ts` + BomTab buttons + View3DTab exploded snapshots + Three/scene.ts exploded offsets.
+
+- `all-phases.patch` – both commits combined (fa0e1c7 + 7d34fd8) from main..HEAD
+
+## How to apply in GitHub repo
+
+### Option A – git apply patch (recommended for single branch)
+
+```sh
+git checkout main
+git pull origin main
+git checkout -b feat/all-phases
+
+# apply combined
+git apply --check patches/all-phases.patch
+git apply patches/all-phases.patch
+
+# or apply separately
+git apply patches/phase-fullDoors-slot-hinge.patch
+git apply patches/phase-3-5-exploded.patch
+
+git add -A
+git commit -m "feat: all phases – full doors L/R/Double + slot editable + hinge bands + back follows material + panel drag + exploded per-cab report"
+npm run build
+git push origin feat/all-phases
+gh pr create --title "All phases – full doors + back follows mat + panel drag + exploded report" --body-file patches/README.md
+```
+
+### Option B – format-patch am
+
+```sh
+git checkout main
+git am patches/phase-fullDoors-slot-hinge.patch
+git am patches/phase-3-5-exploded.patch
+```
+
+### Option C – cherry-pick from this branch (if you have remote)
+
+```sh
+git fetch origin arena/01a083d7-cnc-pro
+git cherry-pick fa0e1c7
+git cherry-pick 7d34fd8
+```
+
+## Verification
+
+```sh
+npm run build
+# should be ~1.3MB singlefile, no tsc errors
+```
+
+## Exploded Report Usage
+
+1. Add cabinets (600×720×560 etc)
+2. Go to 3D View → click PNG (saves overall), click Exploded PNG, click Save All Cab PNGs (saves per-cab iso + exploded to localStorage)
+3. Go to BOM → Save Exploded Report → opens multi-page HTML with per-cabinet pages:
+   - Front elevation single
+   - Exploded View 2D (sides ±150 X, top/bottom ±120 Y, back -100 Z dashed, doors +200 Z 45°)
+   - Open Door View (doors open 90° outside, drawers pulled 60%)
+   - Drilling Map L/R
+   - Panel Size Table (W×H×Thk, qty, material follows plywood name, banding, bend, area, holes, grain, note)
+   - Hardware per cabinet
+
+All offline, single HTML file with embedded SVGs + base64 PNGs, A4 print.
+
+## Notes
+
+- dist/index.html is built file – not needed in patch, will be rebuilt by vite
+- node_modules changes ignored
+- PREVIOUS_CHANGES_AFTER_MERGE.md and EXPLODED_REPORT_PHASE_DETAILS.md are docs for next agent – not needed in production but useful for reconstruction
