+
+Phase #3: Back panels now include matId=cabinetPly.id so 3D color follows plywood material and nesting groups back@matId per plywood (instead of back@def). Note includes follows plywood name.
+
+Phase #5: Panel drag in 2D Front View and Plan View – panels now draggable with snap 5mm, same as cabinets. View2DTab: panelAt hit test, snap to panel edges, movePanel updates layout. PlanTab: panelPlan draggable, setPanels prop, snapX includes panels. App.tsx passes setPanels to both tabs.
+
+New O: Exploded per-cabinet report – new src/lib/explodedReport.ts generates multi-page HTML (A4) with per-cabinet pages:
+- Front elevation (single)
+- Exploded View 2D schematic (sides ±150 X, top/bottom ±120 Y, back -100 Z dashed, doors +200 Z 45° open, shelves floating, toe kick below, leader lines, labels W×H×Thk)
+- Open Door View (doors open 90° outside with hinge dots, drawers pulled 60%, shelves, rails gold, dimensions W×H)
+- Drilling Map side L/R (shelf amber, slide cyan, hinge red, slot 18mm purple dashed, 32mm system)
+- Panel Size Table per cabinet (W×H×Thk, qty, material follows plywood name via matLabel, banding, bend length m, area m², holes, grain locked, note)
+- Hardware per cabinet (hinges auto <900→2 etc, slides by cm, rails, shelf pins)
+
+Overall cover + TOC + overall 3D + front elevation + overall BOM/cut/nesting.
+
+BomTab: buttons Exploded Per-Cab (print) + Save Exploded Report, loads per-cab screenshots from localStorage (cnc-exploded-* and cnc-cab-iso-*) and embeds as base64.
+
+View3DTab: Export view adds Exploded PNG (overall) + Save All Cab PNGs (per-cab iso + exploded). Per-cab list with Iso/Expl buttons saving to localStorage and downloading PNG.
+
+Three/scene.ts: CabinetViewer now has exploded state – setExploded offsets sides ±150 X, top/bottom ±120 Y, back -100 Z, doors +200 Z, drawers +300 Z, shelves +30 Y. Methods snapshotExploded, snapshotCabinet, snapshotExplodedCabinet for per-cab captures. Door open 45° (frac 0.42) for exploded, 100% for open door view.
